  "id": "ENT023",
  "title": "The Bridge of Pauses",
  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "cooperation",
  "premise": "Two musicians must cross a fantasy bridge that grows only during silence, but each keeps filling the other’s pause. They establish a shared breath, wait together, and cross a bridge made from the quiet intervals they finally allow.",
  "hook": "Every note makes the bridge shorter.",
  "visible_action": "Musical notes nibble bridge tiles away; both lower instruments; empty beats produce tiles; footsteps alternate across the gap.",
  "intended_takeaway_or_theme": "Leaving space can be an active contribution.",
  "gate": "Explicit magical rule; no claim about sound creating or destroying structures.",
